              "description": "The low-phase PolyCam mosaic is normalized with the ROLO phase function and Lommel–Seeliger disk function. Its 6.25 cm source sampling covers approximately ±55° latitude. The publisher’s 8-bit stretch maps 0.002–0.007 to 1–254. Gray grid marks source NoData, including the polar gaps.",
              "title": "The low-phase PolyCam mosaic is normalized with the ROLO phase function and Lommel–Seeliger disk function. Its 6.25 cm source sampling covers approximately ±55° latitude. The publisher’s 8-bit stretch maps 0.002–0.007 to 1–254. Gray grid marks source NoData, including the polar gaps.",
