              "description": "The 5 cm global image basemap retains surface texture and photographed shading. It was normalized to 30° phase and registered to the SPC v28 control shape; small differences from the OLA v20 display mesh remain. This is a separate observed image view; it does not silently fill the albedo view’s missing poles.",
              "title": "The 5 cm global image basemap retains surface texture and photographed shading. It was normalized to 30° phase and registered to the SPC v28 control shape; small differences from the OLA v20 display mesh remain. This is a separate observed image view; it does not silently fill the albedo view’s missing poles.",
